    "text": "The Food (Labelling and Advertising) Regulations, 2022, published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2319/40 dated February 14, 2023, as amended by Gazette Extraordinary No. 2364/24 dated December 27, 2023, Gazette Extraordinary No. 2416/51 dated December 28, 2024, Gazette Extraordinary No. 2443/06 dated June 30, 2025 and Gazette Extraordinary No. 2443/27 dated July 01, 2025 are hereby further amended.",
